{"id":"faf6841087a5303b","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-shepherdson-exact-separation.md","title":"Shepherdson’s Separation Theorem S2","display":"thm-shepherdson-exact-separation — Shepherdson’s Separation Theorem S2","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-shepherdson-exact-separation","aliases":["92-thm-shepherdson-exact-separation"],"display":"thm-shepherdson-exact-separation — Shepherdson’s Separation Theorem S2","source":"第 VII 章 p. 93，Theorem S2（PDF 110）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-lem-shepherdson-exact-separation]]","[[92-df-exact-rosser-system]]","[[92-df-smullyan-rosser-system]]","[[92-df-effective-arithmetic-system]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-shepherdson-exact-separation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-shepherdson-exact-separation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-shepherdson-exact-separation — Shepherdson’s Separation Theorem S2"},{"key":"source","html":"第 VII 章 p. 93，Theorem S2（PDF 110）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"64779d4d642bf6b2\" href=\"?note=64779d4d642bf6b2\" title=\"92-lem-shepherdson-exact-separation\">92-lem-shepherdson-exact-separation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6e0988554a7f9a4b\" href=\"?note=6e0988554a7f9a4b\" title=\"92-df-exact-rosser-system\">92-df-exact-rosser-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8d06776406d2e58e\" href=\"?note=8d06776406d2e58e\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-rosser-system\">92-df-smullyan-rosser-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"323282b93f22ef06\" href=\"?note=323282b93f22ef06\" title=\"92-df-effective-arithmetic-system\">92-df-effective-arithmetic-system</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)\">\\(\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con},\\mathrm{Axable}_G,\\mathrm{RosserRel}_G^2,\\mathrm{ExactRosser}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Con},\\mathrm{Axable}_G,\\mathrm{RosserRel}_G^2,\\mathrm{ExactRosser}_G\\)</span> 采用上述依赖的系统性质。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}shepherdson\\text{-}exact\\text{-}separation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathcal S)\\land\\mathrm{Axable}_G(\\mathcal S)\n\\land\\mathrm{RosserRel}_G^2(\\mathcal S)\n\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{ExactRosser}_G(\\mathcal S).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}shepherdson\\text{-}exact\\text{-}separation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathcal S)\\land\\mathrm{Axable}_G(\\mathcal S)\n\\land\\mathrm{RosserRel}_G^2(\\mathcal S)\n\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{ExactRosser}_G(\\mathcal S).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对任意不交的 c.e. 集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\">\\(A,B\\)</span>，上游引理中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U,V\">\\(U,V\\)</span> 均 c.e.，因为可证码及可反驳码均 c.e.，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_G\">\\(\\Pi_G\\)</span> 可计算。二元 Rosser 性质分离其差集，一致性与精确分离引理给出所需一元公式。这里只需二元 Rosser 性质，不预设全元数的性质，也不使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 一致性。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 VII 章 p. 93，Theorem S2（PDF 110）。页码同时给出印刷页与 PDF 页；所有公式均为本地重构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-lem-shepherdson-exact-separation","